covariance matrix, using the columns \code{c11}, \code{c12_re}, \code{c12_im}, ...
of \code{\link[=sar_features]{sar_features()}}. Since all laws share the number of looks, it
only rescales the divergences and does not affect the classification.}
}

The classifier is also available as the 'parsnip' model
\code{\link[=divergence_classifier]{divergence_classifier()}}, for use in 'tidymodels' workflows.
